  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant STATUS_RETURN_AT_EDGE has the value 0x100</p>
  <p>Causes the object to be returned when it goes off world, overrides <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/STATUS_DIE_AT_EDGE" target="_blank">STATUS_DIE_AT_EDGE</a>.</p>
</p>
    </div>

